<section id="signal" class="post-office"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="section-top micro"><span>06 / THE SIGNAL POST</span><span>GOOD IDEAS DESERVE AN ADDRESS.</span></div>
  <div class="post-heading"><div><span class="micro">AN OPEN LINE TO CHIDI & MICHAEL</span><h2>A small letter.<br/><em>A possible beginning.</em></h2></div><p>An app you wish existed.<br/>A problem that won’t leave you alone.<br/>Put it in writing. We’re listening.</p></div>
  <div class="postal-layout">
    <div class="letter-desk">
      <form class="signal-letter" name="boomley-signal" method="POST" action="/thank-you" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-signal-mail>
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="boomley-signal"/>
        <p class="honeypot"><label>Leave empty<input name="bot-field"/></label></p>
        <fieldset class="letter-fields"><div class="letter-address"><div><span class="micro">TO</span><p>Chidi & Michael<br/>The Boomley workbench</p></div><div class="letter-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><span>BOOMLEY</span><b>✳</b><span>SIGNAL POST</span></div></div>
          <label for="mail-subject">This is about</label><input id="mail-subject" name="subject" required maxlength="160" placeholder="An app idea, a problem, a little friction…"/>
          <label class="letter-greeting" for="friction">Dear Boomley,</label><textarea id="friction" name="friction" rows="5" required maxlength="5000" placeholder="Here’s something I’ve noticed… Tell us what happens, who it affects, or the app you wish someone would build."></textarea>
          <div class="letter-signoff"><div><label for="mail-name">From <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="mail-name" name="sender" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name"/></div><div><label for="signal-email">Write back to</label><input id="signal-email" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com"/></div></div>
          <div class="letter-bottom"><p>We’ll use this to read your idea and reply.<br/><a href="/privacy">How we handle your signal ↗</a></p><button class="mail-button" type="submit">Mail this signal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
        </fieldset>
      </form>
      <div class="mail-receipt" hidden tabindex="-1"><span class="receipt-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="micro">DELIVERED TO THE BOOMLEY INBOX</span><h3>Your signal<br/>has <em>arrived.</em></h3><p>Thank you for putting it into words.<br/>We’ll read it and follow up if we have questions.</p><button class="mail-again" type="button">Write another letter ↗</button></div>
      <p class="mail-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="postbox-scene"><span class="postbox-coordinate micro">SOMEWHERE FOR YOUR IDEAS TO LAND.</span><div class="postbox-photo"><img src="/media/observatory/red-postbox-800.webp" srcset="/media/observatory/red-postbox-480.webp 480w, /media/observatory/red-postbox-800.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width:680px) 260px, 38vw" width="800" height="1200" alt="A red enamel postbox ready to receive your signal" loading="lazy"/><div class="postbox-slot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="postbox-inscription" aria-hidden="true"><b>SIGNAL POST</b><span>IDEAS WELCOME.<br/>ALWAYS.</span></div></div><p class="postbox-caption">No perfect pitches.<br/><em>Just something worth noticing.</em></p></div>
  </div>
  <dialog class="mail-stage" aria-label="Posting your signal"><div class="mail-stage-heading"><span class="micro">THE SIGNAL POST</span><p data-stage-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Folding your letter…</p><button class="stage-hide" type="button">Keep browsing ↗</button></div><div class="mail-animation" aria-hidden="true"><div class="stage-box"><img src="/media/observatory/red-postbox-480.webp" width="480" height="720" alt=""/><div class="stage-slot"></div></div><div class="fold-letter"><div class="fold-panel fold-top"><span>TO: CHIDI & MICHAEL</span><i></i></div><div class="fold-panel fold-middle"><span>Dear Boomley,</span><i></i><i></i></div><div class="fold-panel fold-bottom"><i></i><span>A signal worth noticing.</span></div></div><div class="flying-envelope"><div class="envelope-back"></div><div class="envelope-front"><span>TO: BOOMLEY<br/>THE SIGNAL POST</span></div><div class="envelope-flap"></div><span class="envelope-seal">b.</span></div></div></dialog>
</div></section>
